WEBVTT

00:01.340 --> 00:03.480
The blight... has manifested.

00:06.940 --> 00:08.480
No!

00:08.700 --> 00:10.120
That's a Fiend.

00:12.020 --> 00:14.590
A Fiend?

00:17.000 --> 00:23.500
The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King

00:17.480 --> 00:21.000
No! No, no! Release me!

00:24.200 --> 00:25.340
Stop it!

00:27.770 --> 00:30.500
Sera, we cut through it and the woman!

00:30.500 --> 00:32.770
It'll drink her soul dry.

00:33.160 --> 00:35.760
If we act now, she can die 
with her humanity intact.

00:37.630 --> 00:43.020
Don't look at me!
O Lord, please, save me!

00:43.340 --> 00:45.430
Retinue Priest Malcius!

00:45.430 --> 00:46.400
Damned monster!

01:03.120 --> 01:04.390
Aleks?

01:11.170 --> 01:12.360
Malcius!

01:31.480 --> 01:34.520
No! Get out of my head!

01:35.800 --> 01:39.280
It's begun to feast! Warriors, with—

01:39.280 --> 01:40.220
Forgive me, Veor!

01:40.920 --> 01:43.660
The others have no obligation to save her,

01:43.660 --> 01:46.910
but two have already 
died while I stood back.

01:49.240 --> 01:52.920
Anyone... save me...

01:52.920 --> 01:55.370
No more casualties!

01:55.370 --> 01:58.190
By my pride as a knight commander, I will 
not let the people of my homeland...

01:58.190 --> 02:01.300
No! I will not let the helpless 
die when they're within my reach!

02:03.190 --> 02:05.630
With enough willpower, 
I can cut through it!

02:11.730 --> 02:13.020
Not enough to critically wound it...

02:17.150 --> 02:18.330
Release me!

02:27.610 --> 02:29.010
Are you all right, Sera?

02:29.580 --> 02:31.710
Y-Your Thundering Voice...

02:32.280 --> 02:34.380
Still, don't try to stop me, Veor.

02:34.850 --> 02:35.850
I...

02:36.180 --> 02:37.810
We'll help you.

02:39.150 --> 02:40.110
But why?

02:40.110 --> 02:42.120
You're willing to risk your life for hers.

02:42.120 --> 02:43.260
How can we ignore that?

02:44.860 --> 02:51.390
Not after you risked that same 
life to save my sister and nephew.

02:54.180 --> 02:58.860
You earned this debt with your life. 
We're gonna pay it back, just the same.

02:58.860 --> 03:01.860
Let us honor the risk you took.

03:03.260 --> 03:06.870
I'm sorry... No, thank you.

03:14.470 --> 03:15.770
Do you have a plan?

03:15.770 --> 03:17.270
When I used my Thundering Voice,

03:17.270 --> 03:19.710
I saw what I believe to be 
the core of the blight.

03:20.760 --> 03:23.810
The warriors will occupy its 
tentacles, acting as a distraction,

03:23.810 --> 03:26.880
while I will expose the core 
again with my Thundering Voice.

03:26.880 --> 03:30.520
Understood. Then I'm to destroy it?

03:30.830 --> 03:32.310
Can I entrust you with the task?

03:32.570 --> 03:34.060
Of course.

03:34.340 --> 03:35.400
Let's go!

03:35.400 --> 03:36.320
Right!

04:03.510 --> 04:04.890
Pierce it!

04:19.670 --> 04:21.450
That's beautiful...

04:24.410 --> 04:25.620
We did it—

04:29.470 --> 04:31.290
Sera!

04:36.870 --> 04:38.170
My head hurts...

04:38.450 --> 04:41.010
I feel like I had an awful dream—

04:41.920 --> 04:45.970
Wh-What in the world is this?!

04:48.550 --> 04:50.910
M-My scripture and relics are g-gone?!

04:50.910 --> 04:53.730
Wh-Why?! O Lord, what do I do?!

05:00.690 --> 05:02.940
B-Barbarian!

05:02.940 --> 05:05.380
I'm going to be violated, 
passed around, and then murdered!

05:05.380 --> 05:07.910
No!

05:09.530 --> 05:12.150
J-Just try and assault a priest 
like me, and see what happens!

05:12.150 --> 05:14.930
Divine punishment will befall you!

05:14.930 --> 05:17.170
It'll be real bad! So stay away!

05:17.410 --> 05:20.710
I thought she was supposed 
to be strong-willed.

05:21.310 --> 05:24.420
In any case, I doubt we'll be 
having a productive conversation.

05:24.420 --> 05:27.410
Wh-Why would I deign to 
talk with a savage?!

05:27.800 --> 05:30.980
Lady Serafina? Where is Lady Serafina?

05:30.980 --> 05:34.680
Please, smite this barbarian with the 
hammer of justice! I beg you! Please!

05:34.910 --> 05:38.070
Forgive me, Sera, but if 
you could speak to her...

05:41.110 --> 05:42.690
What's wrong, Sera?

05:42.690 --> 05:47.560
I-Is this how I acted
 on my first day here?

05:48.630 --> 05:50.720
Why are you embarrassed?

05:50.720 --> 05:53.200
You needn't compare yourself to her.

05:53.200 --> 05:54.970
Be that as it may...

05:54.970 --> 05:57.180
It's the same as it was in the woods!

05:57.180 --> 05:59.480
Why are you so familiar 
with this savage?!

05:59.480 --> 06:01.110
He's our enemy!

06:01.810 --> 06:05.090
The explanation for 
that will come later...

06:05.720 --> 06:06.850
But I hereby declare,

06:06.850 --> 06:09.530
as a knight commander in
the 17th Eastern Expedition,

06:09.530 --> 06:11.600
that these people are no longer my enemy.

06:14.920 --> 06:19.730
Excuse me?! Wh-Wh-What are you 
saying?! I don't understand!

06:19.730 --> 06:22.690
These barbarians have sworn 
their unsightly vengeance on us

06:22.690 --> 06:23.860
for our holy crusade...

06:23.860 --> 06:25.940
They don't hate us at all.

06:25.940 --> 06:27.120
Why not?!

06:27.120 --> 06:28.250
I'm not sure.

06:28.580 --> 06:31.210
There's no shortage of things that 
haven't made sense to me in my time here.

06:31.210 --> 06:34.980
So, I've decided to stay 
until I understand.

06:38.140 --> 06:43.280
I doubt you remember, 
considering the state you were in,

06:43.280 --> 06:46.380
but the warriors of this 
land helped me save you.

06:49.870 --> 06:52.510
I'm not asking you to feel as I do.

06:53.030 --> 06:56.130
But I know repaying goodwill with bad

06:56.130 --> 06:59.400
goes against the the teachings 
of the Commoneras faith, Malcius.

07:00.850 --> 07:06.020
You've fallen into depravity, haven't you?

07:07.780 --> 07:11.660
Despite being a woman, you were 
the most knightly of knights,

07:11.660 --> 07:16.070
to the point you rose to 
the rank of commander!

07:16.520 --> 07:19.340
Sera, what... what is she?

07:19.340 --> 07:23.920
She's always had a tendency to 
place my knighthood on a pedestal.

07:25.060 --> 07:27.920
A-And what is that salacious outfit?

07:28.160 --> 07:32.520
A-A cleavage window, on top 
of showing so much leg....

07:33.180 --> 07:35.930
You really have been 
made into a sex slave!

07:35.930 --> 07:37.930
You're completely mistaken, you fool!

07:38.190 --> 07:43.310
You're a part of the royal line of 
succession, yet have been defiled...

07:43.310 --> 07:45.500
Would you listen?!

07:45.970 --> 07:49.840
I can only wonder what 
Princess Wysteresia would say,

07:49.840 --> 07:51.320
were she still alive!

07:56.730 --> 07:58.870
Princess Wysteresia...

08:01.010 --> 08:02.280
That...

08:03.800 --> 08:05.770
You may be right.

08:07.840 --> 08:10.710
You think Wysteresia is dead?

08:12.110 --> 08:17.610
Though I suppose that would be the case, 
given she's been missing for 20 years.

08:18.550 --> 08:20.590
How dare you speak so lightly of her?!

08:20.590 --> 08:22.920
Do you realize that after giving 
her life to the crusade,

08:22.920 --> 08:26.360
she was named a Saint by 
the Order of Commoneras?!

08:26.600 --> 08:29.580
I don't know what any of that means,

08:29.580 --> 08:31.490
but if you want to see her, 
that's a simple matter.

08:33.330 --> 08:37.620
The lady knight who came from the west, 
20 years ago, named Wysteresia...

08:38.220 --> 08:40.620
is my mother.

08:44.030 --> 08:47.240
What?!

08:56.470 --> 08:57.010
Honestly?

08:58.060 --> 09:00.780
It makes a modicum of sense that

09:00.780 --> 09:03.290
Princess Wysteresia
could be Veor's mother.

09:03.290 --> 09:04.360
Really?

09:05.080 --> 09:06.270
How are you believing this?!

09:06.550 --> 09:09.860
There is no way that 
savage can be trusted!

09:09.860 --> 09:14.780
I have no doubt he is using the name 
of Saint Wysteresia to deceive us!

09:16.030 --> 09:19.780
I would've thought that too, 
a short while ago.

09:19.780 --> 09:22.040
Wh-Wh-Wha...

09:22.280 --> 09:25.850
But from what I've learned, 
it's something of a tradition

09:25.850 --> 09:29.540
for the warriors of these lands 
to romance lady knights...

09:30.290 --> 09:33.660
For example, Nyleia, 
whom we thought died four years ago,

09:33.660 --> 09:35.820
now has a family here.

09:37.050 --> 09:42.150
Veor is also... c-courting me and...

09:42.760 --> 09:44.950
Is it hot in here?

09:46.140 --> 09:49.180
I-I'll have you know I haven't 
agreed to marry him yet!

09:49.610 --> 09:51.220
But if you were to ask me whether or not

09:51.220 --> 09:53.240
I'm attracted to a man 
who can defeat me...

09:53.240 --> 09:56.290
If you're attracted to him, 
why not get married?

09:56.290 --> 09:59.610
I-It's just that my priority is 
to learn of this land's bounty,

09:59.610 --> 10:02.200
and use that knowledge 
to save my home, first...

10:02.200 --> 10:05.830
Is this that "nobless oblige" thing? 
Seems like quite a pain.

10:06.490 --> 10:08.250
Just think for a moment!

10:08.250 --> 10:12.770
Veor said he would let us see 
Princess Wysteresia before leaving.

10:12.770 --> 10:17.180
Why would he lie about something 
that could be proven so quickly?

10:17.720 --> 10:18.720
But...

10:19.540 --> 10:21.560
I can understand why you're surprised.

10:21.960 --> 10:24.310
But if you're skeptical as a default,

10:24.310 --> 10:26.480
you'll have trouble 
understanding this place.

10:29.230 --> 10:30.730
It's been 20 years...

10:32.060 --> 10:34.910
After losing my mother at an early age,

10:34.910 --> 10:39.670
she was like a sister, a mother, 
and the knight I aspired to.

10:41.870 --> 10:46.290
If she really is alive, 
I'd be so overjoyed.

10:47.660 --> 10:52.100
This is without a doubt the 
willpower of an elite knight!

10:52.100 --> 10:55.000
I-It's giving off such pressure!

10:58.900 --> 11:03.390
You who have come from 
my homeland, Illdoren...

11:04.140 --> 11:07.510
As wife of the great chief, 
I offer you my welcome.

11:09.270 --> 11:13.030
Lady Serafina de Lavillant.

11:13.630 --> 11:17.680
My son and his warriors 
have spoken much of you.

11:17.680 --> 11:19.550
It is my hope you will do well by them.

11:22.610 --> 11:26.590
Now, then... that's enough 
of the high-handed act.

11:26.590 --> 11:27.790
Don't you think, Sera?

11:29.390 --> 11:34.340
That voice... 
Is it really you, Resia?

11:36.380 --> 11:38.550
m 10 0 l 165 0 l 175 10 l 175 70 l 165 80 l 165 80 l 10 80 l 0 70 l 0 10

11:36.380 --> 11:38.550
Veor's Mother
Former 1st Princess of
the Illdoren Kingdom
Wysteresia d'Illdoren

11:39.550 --> 11:41.300
Yeah, Sera!

11:42.550 --> 11:46.760
It's been so long! 
I wanted to see you sooner,

11:46.760 --> 11:50.340
but they said it'd cause my boy 
trouble and asked me to wait!

11:53.070 --> 11:54.810
So...

11:55.100 --> 11:59.190
When did you turn into such a temptress?!

11:59.820 --> 12:04.430
That's right! This is how 
Resia used to act!

12:04.430 --> 12:09.390
Legends were told about the free-spirited 
Princess Knight, Wysteresia!

12:11.670 --> 12:15.830
Mother... I hope you're 
done harassing Sera.

12:17.340 --> 12:20.090
I'm just trying to make 
up for 20 years of separation

12:20.090 --> 12:21.620
from my darling, little relative here!

12:21.620 --> 12:23.550
Or is that a problem?

12:23.550 --> 12:25.550
It clearly is!

12:27.450 --> 12:31.100
More importantly, how far 
have you gotten with her?

12:31.420 --> 12:33.750
I mean... that's...

12:33.750 --> 12:36.230
In accordance with tradition, 
I'm currently courting her...

12:38.620 --> 12:41.110
Just "courting"?! You gotta be kidding me!

12:41.590 --> 12:46.110
So, Sera, have you seriously 
not coupled yet?

12:47.210 --> 12:50.260
I am a maiden in both body 
and soul, dear Sister!

12:52.810 --> 12:56.500
So she's playing hard to get, huh?

12:56.500 --> 13:00.260
I am simply trying to treat Sera properly!

13:00.260 --> 13:02.790
Look at my boy, the fancy-pants gentleman!

13:02.790 --> 13:06.200
Thinks he can keep a girl without 
giving her anything to hold onto...

13:06.890 --> 13:09.850
Mother, would you please stop talking?!

13:11.620 --> 13:14.270
Um... e-excuse me...

13:14.670 --> 13:18.070
A-Are you Saint Wysteresia?

13:18.810 --> 13:24.240
Oh, and you must be a part of 
that crackpot cult of liars

13:24.240 --> 13:27.280
that's somehow still around after 
seventy-eight thousand years...

13:27.280 --> 13:30.630
I'd appreciate you not killing 
me off without asking me.

13:30.630 --> 13:32.430
We are not liars!

13:32.430 --> 13:36.150
The Order of Commoneras are the 
true keepers of humanity's history!

13:36.150 --> 13:40.940
Well, whether that's true or 
not doesn't really matter.

13:40.940 --> 13:44.170
History's nothing but 
baggage in these parts.

13:50.580 --> 13:53.430
Excuse me. It's nearly time.

13:53.430 --> 13:56.180
Oh, I had almost forgotten.

13:56.180 --> 14:00.810
All right, let's get moving. We can fill 
in the details once we get there.

14:01.810 --> 14:03.440
To where?

14:03.440 --> 14:08.390
Sera... you and our warriors hunted 
a true dragon, a rare accomplishment,

14:08.390 --> 14:10.320
along with slaying an accursed Fiend.

14:12.630 --> 14:14.760
Glory is waiting for you out on the beach.

14:43.990 --> 14:45.110
That's...

14:45.790 --> 14:49.740
I'm sure of it. 
The skull of that dragon I slew.

14:50.260 --> 14:52.910
The life that I took with the 
help of Veor and the others.

14:58.180 --> 15:02.720
It's been less than half a day,
 but they've carefully butchered it

15:02.720 --> 15:04.620
and polished the bones...

15:05.170 --> 15:07.460
In the west, such sights of mortality 
are kept in the shadows...

15:07.950 --> 15:10.640
But here, they honor the creature's death,

15:10.640 --> 15:12.630
leaving not a scrap of of bone or fat,

15:12.630 --> 15:15.640
with its flesh becoming 
sustenance for the people...

15:16.100 --> 15:22.120
I haven't been here for long, but I 
can't help myself from feeling grateful.

15:22.690 --> 15:23.650
And...

15:25.890 --> 15:27.810
Excited to eat this!

15:31.590 --> 15:35.820
So good! Morisuberis are delicious!

15:35.820 --> 15:36.630
Sera.

15:37.880 --> 15:41.100
It's good grilled, 
but even better with sauce.

15:41.100 --> 15:42.290
Really?!

15:45.610 --> 15:49.610
Such fluffy meat with fragrant, 
sweet and spicy sauce!

15:49.610 --> 15:51.520
If such beasts were native to the capital,

15:51.520 --> 15:53.300
they'd have been hunted 
to extinction by now!

15:55.390 --> 16:01.070
It's still flavorful when preserved, 
so it fetches quite a price in trade.

16:02.200 --> 16:04.310
Then it's a part of the 
village's economy as well?

16:04.530 --> 16:06.810
Other beasts and dragons are good...

16:07.640 --> 16:10.320
but in terms of taste, 
it truly is the best.

16:15.820 --> 16:17.390
And here we have something that

16:17.390 --> 16:20.130
the fairies from the wetlands 
brewed from local grains.

16:20.130 --> 16:23.830
It's called "quartz wine." 
You won't find a finer liquor!

16:26.530 --> 16:30.110
You drink that... and you'll be gone.

16:30.110 --> 16:30.840
Gone?!

16:52.110 --> 16:56.070
I'm alive!

17:01.370 --> 17:06.030
Look at her face! Surely this 
is some form of blasphemy...

17:06.030 --> 17:07.040
Want some?

17:07.950 --> 17:09.830
Why would I eat such treacherous meat?!

17:12.100 --> 17:15.500
Your stubbornness is only 
making you look more pitiful.

17:16.020 --> 17:18.890
There's nothing sadder than 
an empty stomach, you know.

17:19.830 --> 17:23.680
I might hate what the 
Order of Commoneras stands for,

17:23.680 --> 17:26.510
but I did receive some 
charity from them once...

17:27.620 --> 17:29.020
Does that mean—

17:30.860 --> 17:32.400
Hot! That's hot!

17:33.090 --> 17:34.690
It was a long time ago.

17:35.000 --> 17:37.410
Now, make sure to chew that properly.

17:40.610 --> 17:45.910
You were fortunate enough that Lady Sera 
and the warriors were able to save you.

17:50.990 --> 17:51.920
It's good.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.430
Gone...

18:05.540 --> 18:08.310
They're all... gone...

18:08.860 --> 18:15.150
because I insisted on 
saving Lady Serafina...

18:15.810 --> 18:19.810
I was so convinced it would be easy... 
that nothing could go wrong.

18:20.440 --> 18:23.100
But I'm the only one who survived...

18:30.780 --> 18:32.690
You really are foolish.

18:32.690 --> 18:36.200
Those dead knights joined 
you because they chose to.

18:36.200 --> 18:39.090
You should be relieved to have survived.

18:39.740 --> 18:42.250
This is what I hate about you people.

18:48.060 --> 18:52.110
Gotta say, though... it really 
has been a long time, Sera.

18:52.110 --> 18:58.390
Yes... finding out you're alive... 
I can't imagine any greater joy.

18:58.780 --> 19:03.330
I'm relieved, too. You're fitting 
in better than I figured.

19:03.740 --> 19:06.270
And that engagement necklace suits you.

19:06.270 --> 19:10.520
Excuse me? Engagement... engagement...

19:11.320 --> 19:13.460
Necklace?

19:14.880 --> 19:20.270
Wh-What sense does that make?! 
Isn't it supposed to be a ring?!

19:20.670 --> 19:25.810
The thing is, you'll lose a ring if 
your arm gets bitten off by a dragon!

19:25.810 --> 19:27.550
How strangely pragmatic....

19:27.550 --> 19:33.140
That said, giving a gift to mark an 
engagement is a tradition from the west.

19:33.650 --> 19:37.350
They adopted it out of 
consideration for us.

19:37.350 --> 19:40.350
The standard around here used to be 
a woman seduced the man she fell for,

19:40.350 --> 19:42.980
took him to bed, and gave him a child

19:42.980 --> 19:45.180
that the community
would raise collectively.

19:45.180 --> 19:46.780
Such a... wild approach.

19:48.790 --> 19:54.130
Hundreds of years ago, the eastern 
forces first broke through the woods...

19:58.520 --> 20:01.050
Every time they were chased off, 
prisoners of war were left behind.

20:01.050 --> 20:03.440
Some women fell
 in love with those knights...

20:03.440 --> 20:06.950
And there would always be men 
who fell for lady knights.

20:07.640 --> 20:09.870
And after a while, 
concepts like engagement, marriage,

20:09.870 --> 20:12.730
family units and bloodlines 
took root out here, too.

20:13.770 --> 20:16.650
Trace the family tree of anyone here,

20:17.100 --> 20:20.580
and I doubt you'd find anyone here 
who doesn't have some Illdoren blood.

20:21.260 --> 20:25.890
Which is why there's no issue 
with you and Veor being wed.

20:26.620 --> 20:30.970
And don't think I'm saying 
you've got to marry my Veo.

20:30.970 --> 20:34.710
But if you don't hate him... it's not 
like the courtship will cost you anything.

20:37.910 --> 20:42.720
You can be honest with how you feel. 
No one's gonna hold it against you.

20:43.670 --> 20:45.940
But I... I have an obligation

20:45.940 --> 20:48.340
to bring happiness to the people 
who live on Lavillant lands.

20:49.100 --> 20:52.430
The idea of finding happiness 
before they can...

20:54.170 --> 20:56.350
Listen well, Sera.

20:56.810 --> 21:00.730
You've been fighting for 
other people all this time...

21:00.730 --> 21:02.980
But it's conceited to think you 
can make other people happy,

21:02.980 --> 21:06.740
if you don't even know what 
it means for yourself.

21:14.840 --> 21:19.690
When she puts it like that... 
what would happiness even mean for me?

21:20.630 --> 21:25.610
No need to get so serious. You've
got plenty of time to figure it out.

21:28.380 --> 21:32.620
You seemed pretty damn happy 
with some tasty food in hand.

21:33.510 --> 21:35.210
I'd say that's good enough.

21:41.770 --> 21:46.820
My own happiness? 
I've never even considered it before.

21:48.450 --> 21:50.490
Sera, about tomorrow...

21:51.380 --> 21:52.240
Sera?

22:00.050 --> 22:02.210
Forgive me. Did you need something?

22:02.450 --> 22:04.970
Well, regarding tomorrow's activities...

22:05.320 --> 22:08.010
The Tribal Alliance will be undertaking 
the purpose for their creation.

22:08.010 --> 22:09.720
A great cleansing.

22:10.580 --> 22:13.100
A great... cleansing?

22:10.640 --> 22:13.100
Translation: Lee Francis

Timing: Andy Ellis

Editing: Zachary Carlysle

Quality Control: Salem Alabanza

Translation Check: Sho Stifler

22:19.830 --> 22:24.450
It's time I reveal one of the great 
secrets of these lands to you.
